格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 社区插件目录，自动汇总并基础校验 GitHub 插件，支持搜索、筛选、双语详情与最新版本安装命令复制。Community directory for DeepSeek Harness plugins with automated discovery, basic validation, search, filters, bilingual details, and latest version install commands.","id":"gh:1333311578","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugins","slug":"lwmxiaobei/dsh-plugins","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 社区插件目录，自动汇总并基础校验 GitHub 插件，支持搜索、筛选、双语详情与最新版本安装命令复制。Community directory for DeepSeek"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Harness plugins with automated discovery, basic validation, search, filters, bilingual details, and"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" latest version install commands."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Awesome DSH Plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"社区维护的 DeepSeek Harness 插件导航与介绍目录。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> 收录不代表官方背书、安全审计或运行兼容。安装第三方插件前，请检查上游源码、权限、依赖和许可证。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 插件网站"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"dsh-plugins.org"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 插件目录"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"更新时间：2026-11-09T07:56:55.238Z"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"当前收录 760 个通过基础 bundle 清单校验的插件。插件地址和介绍均来自对应的上游仓库。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 插件 | 介绍 | 包名 | 许可证 | 星标 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: | ---: |\n| Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model |"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" 在 dsh 里装上这个插件即可，无需登录、注册或填 API Key，就能使用包括 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash、Kimi K3 在内的前沿模型——完全免费，不限量。 All you do "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"is install this plugin in dsh: no login, no sign-up, no API key — the frontier models are just there"},{"id":"p11s4","text":", DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and Kimi K3 among them. Completely free, with no usage cap. | `dsh-our-free-mo"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"del` | MIT | 66647 |\n| superdesigndev/treg | OpenRouter for agent tools. Join community here: https:"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"//discord.gg/6mQYYfFMAn | `treg-dsh` | NOASSERTION | 7681 |\n| ccch1mneyyy/dsh-TUI | DSH's officially"},{"id":"p11s7","text":" top-recommended TUI plugin — high performance, low overhead, cute pixel whale, smooth mouse interac"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"tion. One-command install via npm. / DSH 官方首推的 TUI 插件，高性能低占用，可爱像素鲸鱼，流畅鼠标交互，npm 一键安装 | `@deepseek-har"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"ness-tui/dsh-tui` | MIT | 7271 |\n| QingYunA/answer-me-with-html | Answer me with HTML — an agent ski"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"ll that answers hard questions with a one-page HTML you can actually read. 让 AI Agent 用一页 HTML 回答复杂问"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"题。 | `answer-me-with-html` | MIT | 6119 |\n| elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine | 把本机 Wallpaper Engine 的壁"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"纸搬进 DSH 网页界面：场景壁纸由内置 MIT 开源引擎 WebWallGL 实时 WebGL 渲染（粒子 / puppet 骨骼 / SceneScript / 音频反应 / 鼠标交互），失败自动"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"降级内嵌 MP4 与场景静态帧；Web 壁纸严格沙箱 + WE API；iOS 风格液态玻璃 UI 高度自定义，遮挡暂停省电、ffmpeg 帧率上限转码、系统音频频谱与 Now Playing、自定义"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"上传与自动轮播；设置存宿主端，对 agent 零 token 开销。Windows / macOS / Linux 三平台原生（同一个包、同一条命令）。 | `dsh-plugin-wallpaper"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"-engine` | MIT | 6074 |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 查找插件"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 安装插件"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"安装命令默认只预览，不执行上游代码："},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"确认上游代码和许可证后，加入 `--execute` 执行安装。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 收录规则"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"同步程序从 GitHub 的 `dsh-plugin` 主题发现候选仓库。只有根目录 `package.json` 声明 `dsh.bundle.patch`，对应 patch 文件真实存在，且仓库未"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"归档、未禁用、不是模板的项目，才进入上面的目录。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"机器可读目录见 catalog/plugins.json。全部候选及未收录原因见 catalog/repositories.json。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 自动更新"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"GitHub Actions 每天北京时间 09:17 自动发现和校验插件。目录内容发生变化时，工作流会自动提交到 `main`。也可以在 Actions 页面手动运行 `sync plugins`。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 更新目录"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"本仓库只保存导航数据、文档和维护脚本，不复制或嵌入任何第三方插件源码。插件版权与许可证归各上游